@ [source_snapshot_uuid] 1df674af-2786-4135-972f-3ac52bfba036

& [Forms]
  + EvidenceManifest contains closed profile source snapshot and exactly four sorted artifact identities
  + PreparationResult contains closed selected executable fixture schema process and final-admission observations
  + InventoryRow contains safe relative path positive-or-zero byte count and canonical uppercase SHA256
  + B1PreflightRecord contains profile disposition authority preparation identity refusal counts physical boundary recovery and self-digest

& [Invariants]
  + manifest paths are exact simple filenames and resolve only beneath the supplied evidence root
  + every raw artifact is bounded rehashed before parse and exactly represented once
  + TSV rows are LF-terminated tab-three-field sorted unique safe forward paths with exact aggregate bytes and digest
  + NotRun requires run_count transcript provider model MCP network mutation all zero physical_contact and may_have_mutated false cleanup_performed false and exact refusal
  + record digest is domain-separated SHA256 over the form with an all-zero digest placeholder

& [DualHemisphere]
  + semantic hemisphere owns incompatibility meaning refusal authority and unresolved frontier
  + physical hemisphere owns raw evidence bytes inventory counts and digest recomputation
  + convergence is one deterministic nonauthorizing NotRun record
